{"id":"bowl","name":"Bowl","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:bowl"],"groups":["Made of gold"],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Bowl","text":"The sockets of the lamps of the golden candlestick of the tabernacle are called bowls (Ex. 25:31, 33, 34; 37:17, 19, 20); the same word so rendered being elsewhere rendered “cup” (Gen. 44:2, 12, 16), and wine “pot” (Jer. 35:5). The reservoir for oil, from which pipes led to each lamp in Zechariah’s vision of the candlestick, is called also by this name (Zech. 4:2, 3); so also are the vessels used for libations (Ex. 25:29; 37:16)."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H7086","lemma":"קְעָרָה","xlit":"qᵉʻârâh","gloss":"a bowl","kjv":"charger, dish","count":16,"share":0.73},{"strong":"H4219","lemma":"מִזְרָק","xlit":"mizrâq","gloss":"a bowl","kjv":"bason, bowl","count":17,"share":0.77},{"strong":"H4948","lemma":"מִשְׁקָל","xlit":"mishqâl","gloss":"weight","kjv":"weight","count":13,"share":0.59},{"strong":"H1101","lemma":"בָּלַל","xlit":"bâlal","gloss":"to overflow","kjv":"anoint, confound, fade, mingle","count":12,"share":0.55},{"strong":"H5560","lemma":"סֹלֶת","xlit":"çôleth","gloss":"flour","kjv":"flour, meal","count":12,"share":0.55},{"strong":"H8255","lemma":"שֶׁקֶל","xlit":"sheqel","gloss":"probably a weight","kjv":"shekel","count":12,"share":0.55}],"verses":["Exod.25.29","Exod.37.16","Num.4.7","Num.7.13","Num.7.19","Num.7.25","Num.7.31","Num.7.37","Num.7.43","Num.7.49","Num.7.55","Num.7.61","Num.7.67","Num.7.73","Num.7.79","Num.7.84","1Kgs.7.50","1Chr.28.17","2Chr.4.8","Eccl.12.6","Zech.14.20","Zech.14.21"],"related":[{"id":"basin","type":"seealso","why":"Nave's Topical Bible lists it under See also"},{"id":"charger","type":"cooccur","shared":13,"jaccard":0.52,"why":"13 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"spoons","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.125,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"basin","type":"cooccur","shared":3,"jaccard":0.107,"why":"3 verses are indexed under both"},{"id":"silver